 "history": "Point Nine was founded in Berlin in 2011 by Christoph Janz and Pawel Chudzinski, when Team Europe's venture arm became an independent seed fund; Janz had invested as an angel since 2008, starting with Zendesk. It became known for early bets on software and marketplaces, among them Delivery Hero, Revolut, Algolia, Contentful and Loom. It raised its seventh fund in 2025 and now also backs AI companies and software for the physical world.",
